Package: Rjif
Title: The 'Jif' Statement: Judgment-Based Control Flow via TypeSafe Jev
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Yue", "Shentu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "n43368410@gmail.com")
Description: Replaces hard-coded 'if' conditions with calibrated semantic decisions.
    Wraps the TypeSafe Jev 'System One' API (Choice, Score, Noul primitives) and
    provides jif()/jmatch() control-flow verbs plus a vectorized evaluator that
    scores whole data frames (e.g. eCRF narratives) in batched API calls, with
    calibrated confidence, abstention sentinels, and selection-failure analytics.
